      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note><div>Moving Sat Aug 8. Flying BWI? no — ROA -&gt; SFO via CLT. Room at the incubator house is furnished.</div><div><br/></div><h3>Before (Blacksburg)</h3><div><en-todo checked="true"/>sell desk + chair (FB marketplace, $60)</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>donate kitchen stuff I won't ship</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>ship 6 boxes UPS ground (books, kitchen basics, winter clothes) -&gt; arrive ~8/12</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>bike: box it at the shop ($50) and ship? -&gt; shipped w/ BikeFlights, $89</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>cancel internet (last day 8/7), electric transfer off 8/8</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>USPS mail forwarding to SF starting 8/8</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>lease end walkthrough 8/7 10am, keys back</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>car: sold to the dealership on 7/30. cancel car insurance after title transfer -&gt; done 8/3</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>VT parking permit refund (prorated)</div><h3>Arrival (SF)</h3><div><en-todo checked="true"/>keys from Lena / house manager</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>Clipper card on phone</div><div><en-todo checked="false"/>update address: bank, VT records (Grace), Garmin, Evernote billing</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>grocery run, label fridge shelf</div><div><en-todo checked="false"/>find a gym or pool</div><div><en-todo checked="false"/>CA driver license? only needed if staying &gt; 10 days for residency... look it up</div><div><br/></div><div>8/9: arrived 8/8 at 7:40 pm. boxes not here yet. house is great. Sam showed me the run route to the Embarcadero.</div></en-note>]]>
    </content>
  </note>
